"Always redirects every call immediately. When Busy applies while you are on "
"another call, When Unanswered after the phone has rung for the chosen time, "
"and When Unreachable when the phone is off or out of coverage.\n"
"\n"
"Enter numbers in international format, for example +358401234567. Applying "
"an empty number turns that rule off."
msgstr "Ka mahia te tuku whakamua i te whatunga i mua i te taenga o te waea ki tō waea.\n\nKa tuku whakamua te „I ngā wā katoa“ i ngā waea katoa i te tonu. Ka whai mana te „Ina pukumahi“ i a koe i tētahi atu waea, te „Ina kāore he whakautu“ i muri i te tangi o te waea mō te wā i kōwhiria, ā, ko te „Ina kāore e taea te whakapā“ ina kua whakawetohia te waea, kei waho rānei i te rohe.\n\nTāuruhia ngā nama i te hōputu ao, hei tauira +358401234567. Mā te whakamahi i tētahi nama kau ka whakawetohia taua ture."

