msgstr "Ka taea te whakapā i ngā wā katoa, ahakoa kāore he SIM"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:844
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. Bluetooth and USB levels apply "
"when those call routes are active."
msgstr "Koinei te kaha oro waea mō ia putanga. Ka whai mana te taumata mā ia anō ina hono te waea, me ia wā ka rereke te putanga i waenga i tētahi waea, ā, ka rangona ngā panoni o te pānekeneke i te tonu. Ka whakamahia ngā taumata e te taputapu mā ngā hīkoi matotoru, ā, kāore te pūoro taringa e tino ngū rawa. Ka whai mana ngā taumata Bluetooth me USB ina kaha ana aua huarahi waea."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:847
msgid ""
"When enabled, the network is asked to confirm when your text and multimedia "
"messages reach the recipient's phone.\n"
"\n"
"A confirmation is reliable when it arrives, but many carriers and automated "
"senders never produce one, so a message without a confirmation may still "
"have been delivered. Delivered never means read."
msgstr "Ina whakaarahia, ka tonoa te whatunga kia whakatūturu i te wā ka tae ō karere kuputuhi me ō karere pāpāho maha ki te waea o te tangata e whiwhi ana.\n\nHe pono te whakatūturu ina tae mai, engari he maha ngā kamupene me ngā kaituku aunoa kāore e hanga i tētahi, nō reira tērā pea kua tae tētahi karere kāore he whakatūturu. Ehara te „Kua tae“ i te „Kua pānuihia“."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:934
